<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <base target="_top">
  <meta name="description" content="Sistem Informasi Trantibum (SI TRANTIBUM) - Satuan Polisi Pamong Praja dan Kebakaran Kabupaten Trenggalek">
  
  <!-- Favicon Perisai -->
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>🛡️</text></svg>">
  
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#064e3b">
<meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<title>SI TRANTIBUM — Satpol PPK Kab. Trenggalek</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<script>
  tailwind.config = { 
    theme: { 
      extend: { 
        colors: { 
          satpol: { light: '#14532d', DEFAULT: '#064e3b', dark: '#022c22' } 
        },
        fontFamily: {
          sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
        }
      } 
    } 
  };
</script>

<script src="https://unpkg.com/vue@3.5.13/dist/vue.global.prod.js"></script>
<script>
  if (typeof Vue === "undefined") {
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
      const f = document.getElementById("cdn-fallback");
      if (f) f.style.display = "flex";
      const p = document.getElementById("preloader");
      if (p) p.style.display = "none";
    });
  }
</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">

<style>
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
  [v-cloak] { display: none !important; }
  ::selection { background-color: #10b981; color: #ffffff; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #94a3b8; }
  * { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #cbd5e1 transparent; }
  .inp { width:100%; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:.75rem; padding:.625rem .75rem; font-size:.75rem; background:#fff; transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out; }
  .inp:focus { outline:none; border-color:#065f46; box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(6,95,70,.18); background: #f8fafc; }
  .inp:disabled { background-color: #f1f5f9; cursor: not-allowed; color: #94a3b8; }
  .lbl { display:block; font-weight:600; color:#334155; margin-bottom:.375rem; font-size:.75rem; }
  .rown { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; width:1.25rem; height:1.25rem; border-radius:.375rem; background:#022c22; color:#fff; font-size:10px; font-weight:800; margin-right:.5rem; }
  .glass-panel { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); }
  .text-glow { text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.5); }
  @keyframes float { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); } 50% { transform: translateY(-12px); } }
  @keyframes shake { 0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); } 20%, 60% { transform: translateX(-6px); } 40%, 80% { transform: translateX(6px); } }
  @keyframes shimmer { 0% { background-position: -1000px 0; } 100% { background-position: 1000px 0; } }
  @keyframes fadeInUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  .animate-float { animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .animate-shake { animation: shake 0.6s cubic-bezier(.36,.07,.19,.97) both; }
  .animate-fade-up { animation: fadeInUp 0.4s ease-out forwards; }
  .shimmer-bg { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #10b981 0%, #34d399 50%, #10b981 100%); background-size: 1000px 100%; animation: shimmer 2.5s infinite linear; }
  @media print {
    body * { visibility: hidden; }
    #print-area, #print-area * { visibility: visible; }
    #print-area { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: block !important; padding: 0; margin: 0; width: 100%; }
    * { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important; print-color-adjust: exact !important; }
    @page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 15mm 20mm; }
    tr { page-break-inside: avoid; }
  }
  #cdn-fallback {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 200; display: none;
    background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0; padding: 24px;
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; gap: 12px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 antialiased">

<div id="cdn-fallback">
  <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;">Aplikasi Tidak Dapat Dimuat</h2>
  <p style="max-width:420px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">CDN library gagal dimuat. Periksa koneksi internet dan muat ulang halaman. Jika masalah berlanjut, hubungi administrator sistem.</p>
  <button onclick="location.reload()" style="margin-top:12px;padding:10px 20px;background:#059669;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;">Muat Ulang</button>
</div>
  
  <div id="preloader" class="fixed inset-0 z-[110] bg-slate-950 flex flex-col items-center justify-center transition-opacity duration-300">
    <div class="w-12 h-12 border-4 border-emerald-500/20 border-t-emerald-500 rounded-full animate-spin mb-4 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(16,185,129,0.5)]"></div>
    <p class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase animate-pulse">Menyiapkan Sistem...</p>
  </div>

  <div id="app" v-cloak>
  <div v-if="loading" class="fixed inset-0 z-[100] flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-slate-950 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[50vw] h-[50vw] max-w-[600px] max-h-[600px] bg-emerald-600 rounded-full mix-blend-screen filter blur-[100px] opacity-20 animate-pulse"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-[-10%] right-[-10%] w-[40vw] h-[40vw] max-w-[500px] max-h-[500px] bg-teal-500 rounded-full mix-blend-screen filter blur-[120px] opacity-20 animate-pulse" style="animation-delay: 1s;"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-28 h-28 mb-8 group">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border-t-4 border-r-4 border-emerald-500 animate-spin group-hover:border-emerald-400 transition-colors"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-3 rounded-full border-b-4 border-l-4 border-teal-400 animate-spin" style="animation-direction: reverse; animation-duration: 1.5s;"></div>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-4xl text-emerald-400 animate-pulse drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(52,211,153,0.5)]"></i>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-widest uppercase mb-1 drop-shadow-lg">SI TRANTIBUM</h2>
      <p class="text-emerald-400/80 font-medium text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-10 flex items-center gap-2">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-satellite-dish text-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></i> Sinkronisasi Data
      </p>
      <div class="w-64 h-2 bg-slate-800/80 rounded-full overflow-hidden shadow-inner border border-slate-700/50 relative">
        <div class="h-full w-full shimmer-bg rounded-full"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent -translate-x-full animate-[shimmer_2s_infinite]"></div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[10px] mt-5 font-mono tracking-widest">GAS + SPREADSHEET ENGINE</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div v-else-if="loadError" class="fixed inset-0 z-[100] flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-950 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-[40vw] h-[40vw] max-w-[500px] max-h-[500px] bg-red-600 rounded-full mix-blend-screen filter blur-[120px] opacity-10"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-slate-700/50 rounded-3xl p-8 max-w-lg w-full text-center shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] animate-float">
      <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-red-500/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner border border-red-500/20">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation text-4xl text-red-500 animate-shake drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(239,68,68,0.5)]"></i>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-white mb-2 tracking-wide">Koneksi Terputus</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Gagal memuat data dari Spreadsheet.<br>Pastikan deployment Web App versi terbaru dan koneksi stabil.</p>
      <div class="bg-slate-950/80 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 mb-8 text-left shadow-inner relative group">
        <div class="flex gap-3 items-start">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-terminal text-slate-600 mt-1 text-sm"></i>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-red-400 break-all leading-relaxed pr-8">{{ loadError }}</p>
        </div>
        <button @click="navigator.clipboard.writeText(loadError); flash.text='Pesan error disalin!'; flash.type='success'; setTimeout(()=>flash.text='',3000)" title="Salin Pesan Error" class="absolute top-3 right-3 p-2 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 rounded-lg text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100">
          <i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
      <button @click="refresh" class="group relative w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-5 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-teal-500 text-white text-sm font-bold rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-500/30 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/20 translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out"></div>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-right group-hover:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-500"></i> 
        <span>Coba Hubungkan Ulang</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div v-else class="min-h-screen flex flex-col relative">
  
    <transition name="toast">
      <div v-if="flash.text" class="fixed top-20 right-4 sm:right-6 z-[90] max-w-sm w-full animate-fade-up">
        <div :class="flash.type === 'error' ? 'bg-white border-red-500 text-slate-800' : 'bg-white border-emerald-500 text-slate-800'" class="p-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 shadow-2xl flex items-start gap-3 backdrop-blur-xl bg-opacity-95">
          <div :class="flash.type === 'error' ? 'bg-red-100 text-red-600' : 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600'" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <i :class="flash.type === 'error' ? 'fa-solid fa-circle-xmark' : 'fa-solid fa-circle-check'"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-1">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold">{{ flash.type === 'error' ? 'Terjadi Kesalahan' : 'Berhasil' }}</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">{{ flash.text }}</p>
          </div>
          <button @click="flash.text = ''" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 p-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </transition>

    <transition name="fade">
      <div v-if="busy" class="fixed top-20 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-[90] bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur-md text-white text-xs font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] flex items-center gap-3 border border-slate-700">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-notch fa-spin text-emerald-400 text-sm"></i>
        {{ busyMode === 'save' ? 'Menyimpan ke Database…' : 'Memuat Ulang Data…' }}
      </div>
    </transition>

    <header class="bg-satpol/95 backdrop-blur-md text-white shadow-lg z-40 sticky top-0 border-b border-emerald-900/50 transition-all duration-300">
      <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 min-w-0">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400 to-amber-600 text-slate-900 p-2 rounded-xl shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(245,158,11,0.3)] shrink-0 transform hover:scale-105 transition">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <h1 class="font-extrabold text-sm sm:text-base tracking-wide truncate drop-shadow-sm">SI TRANTIBUM <span class="font-normal text-emerald-200 hidden sm:inline">| SATPOL PPK</span></h1>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-emerald-200/80 truncate tracking-wider uppercase">Kab. Trenggalek</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
          <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center gap-3 bg-emerald-900/40 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-700/50">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-400 to-teal-500 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-900 font-extrabold text-xs shadow-inner">
              {{ currentUser && currentUser.name ? currentUser.name.charAt(0).toUpperCase() : 'U' }}
            </div>
            <div class="text-right pr-2">
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-50 leading-tight">{{ currentUser ? currentUser.name : '' }}</p>
              <p class="text-[9px] text-emerald-300/80 uppercase tracking-wider">
                {{ currentUser && currentUser.jabatan ? currentUser.jabatan : '' }} 
                <span v-if="currentUser && currentUser.pangkatGol"> • {{ currentUser.pangkatGol }}</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative">
            <select v-model="role" @change="switchRole" class="appearance-none bg-slate-900 text-xs text-white font-bold border border-emerald-600/50 rounded-lg pl-3 pr-8 py-2 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-400 cursor-pointer shadow-sm">
              <option v-for="r in ROLES" :value="r">Simulasi: {{ r }}{{ r === 'PIMPINAN' ? ' (sign)' : '' }}</option>
            </select>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down absolute right-2.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-emerald-400 pointer-events-none text-[10px]"></i>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="flex-1 flex w-full max-w-[1440px] mx-auto">
      <aside :class="sidebarCollapsed ? 'w-[76px]' : 'w-64'" class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-300 flex-none hidden md:flex flex-col justify-between sticky top-16 h-[calc(100vh-4rem)] transition-[width] duration-300 overflow-hidden border-r border-slate-800/50 z-30 shadow-2xl">
        <div :class="sidebarCollapsed ? 'p-2.5' : 'p-4'" class="space-y-1.5 overflow-y-auto overflow-x-hidden custom-scrollbar">
          <div :class="sidebarCollapsed ? 'justify-center' : 'justify-between px-1'" class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <p v-if="!sidebarCollapsed" class="px-2 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Menu Utama</p>
            <button @click="toggleSidebar" :title="sidebarCollapsed ? 'Besarkan sidebar' : 'Ciutkan sidebar'" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-emerald-900 text-slate-400 hover:text-white border border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-700 transition-all shrink-0">
              <i :class="sidebarCollapsed ? 'fa-solid fa-angles-right text-sm' : 'fa-solid fa-angles-left text-xs'"></i>
              <span v-if="!sidebarCollapsed" class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">Tutup</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          
          <button v-for="n in navItems" :key="n.key" @click="tab = n.key" :title="sidebarCollapsed ? n.label : ''"
                  :class="[sidebarCollapsed ? 'justify-center px-2' : 'gap-3 px-3', tab === n.key ? 'bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-900/80 to-emerald-800/40 text-white font-semibold border-l-4 border-emerald-500 shadow-[inset_0_0_20px_rgba(16,185,129,0.1)]' : 'hover:bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 border-l-4 border-transparent hover:text-slate-200']" class="relative w-full flex items-center py-2.5 rounded-r-xl rounded-l-none text-sm transition-all duration-200 group">
            <i :class="[n.icon, tab === n.key ? 'text-emerald-400' : 'group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors']" class="w-5 text-center text-base shrink-0"></i>
            <span v-if="!sidebarCollapsed" class="truncate">{{ n.label }}</span>
            <span v-if="n.badge" :class="sidebarCollapsed ? 'absolute top-1 right-1 text-[9px] min-w-[18px] h-[18px] px-1 flex items-center justify-center ring-2 ring-slate-950' : 'ml-auto text-[11px] px-1.5 py-0.5'" class="bg-amber-500 text-slate-900 font-extrabold rounded-full shadow-sm">{{ n.badge }}</span>
          </button>
          
          <div v-if="role === 'ADMIN'" class="pt-6 mt-4 border-t border-slate-800/50">
            <p v-if="!sidebarCollapsed" class="px-3 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Sistem</p>
            <button @click="tab = 'admin'" :title="sidebarCollapsed ? 'Kelola Pengguna & Master Data' : ''" :class="[sidebarCollapsed ? 'justify-center px-2' : 'gap-3 px-3', tab === 'admin' ? 'bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-900/80 to-sky-800/40 text-white font-semibold border-l-4 border-sky-500 shadow-[inset_0_0_20px_rgba(14,165,233,0.1)]' : 'hover:bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 border-l-4 border-transparent hover:text-slate-200']" class="w-full flex items-center py-2.5 rounded-r-xl rounded-l-none text-sm transition-all duration-200 group">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-users-gear w-5 text-center text-base shrink-0" :class="tab === 'admin' ? 'text-sky-400' : 'group-hover:text-sky-400'"></i>
              <span v-if="!sidebarCollapsed" class="truncate">Kelola Pengguna &amp; Master</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div :class="sidebarCollapsed ? 'p-3 text-center' : 'p-5'" class="bg-slate-900/50 text-xs text-slate-500 border-t border-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-md relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-900/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
          <span v-if="sidebarCollapsed" class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(52,211,153,0.8)]"></span>
          <template v-else>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(52,211,153,0.8)]"></span>
              <p class="font-bold text-slate-300 tracking-wide">Workspace Aktif</p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Data tersimpan permanen di Spreadsheet. <br>Mode: <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">{{ role }}</span></p>
          </template>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <main class="flex-1 min-w-0 p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 pb-24 md:pb-8 bg-slate-50/50">

      <section v-if="tab === 'dashboard'" class="space-y-6 animate-fade-up">
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-950 via-emerald-900 to-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 text-white shadow-2xl border border-emerald-800/30">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-20 -mt-20 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 blur-3xl"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 -ml-20 -mb-20 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-teal-500/10 blur-3xl"></div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between gap-6">
            <div class="space-y-3 max-w-2xl">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30 font-extrabold text-[11px] rounded-full uppercase tracking-widest backdrop-blur-sm">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse"></span> Dashboard Operasional
              </span>
              <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Selamat datang, <br class="sm:hidden">{{ currentUser ? currentUser.name : '' }}</h2>
              <p class="text-emerald-100/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">Alur ringkas tanpa operator: Koordinator atau Pimpinan menyusun ST, persetujuan Pimpinan sekaligus menerbitkan nomor resmi, lalu laporan {{ data.activityTypes.length }} jenis kegiatan diverifikasi Koordinator hingga tindak lanjut ber-PIC.</p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2 text-[11px] font-semibold">
                <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-md ring-1 ring-white/10 shadow-inner"><i class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot text-emerald-400 mr-1"></i> {{ data.regions.length }} Kecamatan</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-md ring-1 ring-white/10 shadow-inner"><i class="fa-solid fa-house-chimney text-emerald-400 mr-1"></i> {{ data.villages.length }} Desa/Kel</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-md ring-1 ring-white/10 shadow-inner"><i class="fa-solid fa-users text-emerald-400 mr-1"></i> {{ data.users.length }} Pengguna</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex lg:flex-col gap-3 shrink-0 justify-center">
              <button v-if="canCreateLetter" @click="openNewLetter" class="group relative px-6 py-3.5 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-900 font-bold text-sm rounded-xl shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(245,158,11,0.3)] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(245,158,11,0.5)] transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/20 translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-plus relative z-10"></i> <span class="relative z-10">Buat Surat Tugas</span>
              </button>
              <button @click="openNewReport()" class="group px-6 py-3.5 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-white ring-1 ring-white/20 hover:ring-white/40 font-bold text-sm rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 backdrop-blur-sm hover:-translate-y-0.5">
